   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Indicator 1.1.1: Number of Laws approved  that have been consulted with CSOs and other stakeholders
Indicator 1.1.2: Number of initiatives started by technical staff and approved by MPs in the related committees and the plenum
Indicator 1.1.3: A parliamentary channel (web-based and of easy connection to a regular TV channel) for diffusion of information about the National Assembly and on its work
Indicator 1.1.3 A: Number of communication materials developed and disseminated 
Indicator 1.1.3 B: Number of visits to the ANP website &amp; the &quot;Gabinete do Cidad&#xe3;o&quot;&apos;s Facebook page
Indicator 1.1.4: Developed e-voting system for the plenary of the ANP
Indicator 1.1.4 A: Improved website operational
Indicator 1.1.4 B: National legislation digitalised and available on the ANP&apos;s website</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="FR">Indicator 1.1.1: Baseline TBD /Target 2
Indicator 1.1.2:  Baseline TBD /Target 2
Indicator 1.1.3: Baseline 0 / Target 1
Indicator 1.1.3 A: Baseline 0 / Target 1
Indicator 1.1.3 B: Baseline: TBD / Target: X amount of users connect to the pages
Indicator 1.1.4:  Baseline 0 / Target 1
Indicator 1.1.4 A: Baseline: 1 / Target: new version website launched and operational
Indicator 1.1.4 B: Baseline: 7 / Target: 50</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="FR">1.	Self-assessment of the National Assembly conducted;
2.	IT equipment for the National Assembly bought (printers, scanners and laptops);
3.	Engineering firm contracted to conduct a feasibility study for the construction of the House of Justice in Buba;
4.	Needs assessment of local population in Buba and Catio conducted.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="FR">1. Self-assessment developed and delivered to the National Assembly. 
2. IT equipment bought and shipped from provider.
3 Engineering firm contracted to conduct the feasibility study, produce the Bill of Quantity and assist the UNDP office in hiring a construction company.
4. Needs assessment of the local population in Buba and Catio conducted.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="FR">1. Self-assessment of the ANP conducted and calendar of trainings developed based on the needs and requests of the Assembly.
2. At least two trainings conducted on issues related to roles of parliament and the WPS or YPS agendas. 
3. Audio and video equipment brought for the broadcasting of the plenary in the ANPs web channels. 
4. Content developed for the YouTube channel of the ANP. 
5. Research partnership established between one research center and the ANP.
6. Feasibility study and bill of quantity finalized and construction company identified. 
7. Trainings for judges conducted.
8. Support to CAJ specific activities in the Southern province conducted.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
